# ZeroClaw 完整部署教程

## 一、环境准备

### 系统要求
- **操作系统**: Linux (Ubuntu/Debian/CentOS)
- **内存**: 1GB+ (构建时需要，运行时 <5MB)
- **CPU**: 任意
- **磁盘**: 5GB+

### 安装依赖
```bash
apt-get update
apt-get install -y curl git build-essential
```

---

## 二、安装 Rust

```bash
# 下载并安装 Rust
curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh

# 加载环境变量
source $HOME/.cargo/env

# 验证安装
rustc --version
cargo --version
```

---

## 三、构建 ZeroClaw

```bash
# 克隆项目
git clone https://github.com/zeroclaw-labs/zeroclaw.git
cd zeroclaw

# 构建（内存 < 2GB 时使用单线程）
cargo build --release
# 或
CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=1 cargo build --release

# 验证
./target/release/zeroclaw --version
```

---

## 四、配置 AI Provider

### 创建配置目录和文件
```bash
mkdir -p ~/.zeroclaw

cat > ~/.zeroclaw/config.toml << 'EOF'
api_key = "你的API-Key"
default_provider = "anthropic-custom:https://api.minimax.io/anthropic"
default_model = "MiniMax-M2.5"
default_temperature = 0.7

[observability]
backend = "none"

[autonomy]
level = "supervised"
workspace_only = true
allowed_commands = ["git", "npm", "cargo", "ls", "cat", "grep", "find", "echo", "pwd", "wc", "head", "tail"]
forbidden_paths = ["/etc", "/root", "/proc", "/sys", "~/.ssh", "~/.gnupg", "~/.aws"]

[runtime]
kind = "native"

[memory]
backend = "sqlite"
auto_save = true

[gateway]
port = 8080
host = "0.0.0.0"
require_pairing = false
allow_public_bind = true

[channels_config]
cli = true

[channels_config.telegram]
enabled = true
bot_token = "你的BotToken"
allowed_users = ["*"]

[secrets]
encrypt = true
EOF
```

